  "description": "The Affinity x Terry B single speed/track frame set is in stock!\nAffinity is thrilled to release the limited edition frame sets inspired by Terry Barentsen's vision to create a perfect single speed/track frame set.\nSet it up as a single speed with internal brake routing, or fixed! It's fast, twitchy, fits 35c tires and features double water bottle mounts for all day rides. The 4130 double butted frame has a short rear triangle for super slammed wheels, an oversized down tube, dropped seat stays and Campy-style dropouts.\nOther features include an oversized head tube (headset included), and a 1 1/8th to 1.5 full carbon fork. Raw finish with ED rust preventative coating and a satin clear coat with minimal graphics.\nAvailable in 5 sizes, XS - XL for riders like Terry who are 6'3\".",
